  "fullDescription": "Bring a warm and festive touch to your holiday 3D printing collection with this Christmas Decorative Basket 3D STL. Featuring a charming Christmas-inspired basket design, this model is perfect for creating a cozy seasonal atmosphere in your home.\n\nThe decorative basket can be displayed on tables, shelves, entryway surfaces, or as part of a Christmas centerpiece. Its versatile design also makes it a great addition to holiday decoration collections and festive DIY projects.\n\nProduct Highlights\nDetailed Christmas decorative basket STL\nFestive holiday-inspired design\nCharming decorative appearance\nGreat for Christmas displays and centerpieces\nSuitable for shelves, tables, and other surfaces\nCan be scaled for different display sizes\nSTL file format\nDesigned for 3D printing\nDigital product — no physical item included\nColor Customization\n\nCustomize the basket using slicer software such as Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, Cura, or other compatible software. Try traditional Christmas colors or create a unique look with your preferred filament colors.\n\nPrinting & Technical Recommendations\n\nFile Format: STL\nCompatibility: Suitable for FDM and Resin 3D printers\nFilament Suggestion: PLA, Matte PLA, Silk PLA, or other decorative filaments\nSupports: Support requirements may vary depending on model orientation and printer settings\nScalability: The model can be scaled to suit your preferred decoration size\n\nIdeal For\n\nChristmas home decor\nHoliday decorations\nChristmas table centerpieces\nFestive shelf displays\nChristmas party decoration\nHoliday gift projects\nSeasonal home styling\nChristmas collections\nDIY holiday crafts\n3D printing collections\n\nNote: This is a digital STL file, not a physical product. A compatible 3D printer is required to create the physical model. No physical item will be shipped.",
